# Never publish anything that attributes review activity to a named program,
# or that contains findings. Coordinated disclosure: results stay private
# until the program authorizes disclosure.
#
# NOTE: git does not support trailing comments on pattern lines — keep
# comments on their own line or the pattern silently stops matching.

# your live queue — names programs, contains local paths
targets.md

# real candidate findings, written by the continuous-review loop
findings-log.md

# personal session state; references specific targets reviewed
HANDOFF.md

# anything you keep per-target
notes/
clones/
*.local.md
